      {"id": "gain_base_iso", "propCode": "0xD020", "reason": "Cinema camera setup only (PTP3)"},
      {"id": "audio_input_ch1_level", "propCode": "0xE04C", "reason": "Cinema camera audio setup (PTP3)"},
      {"id": "audio_input_ch2_level", "propCode": "0xE04D", "reason": "Cinema camera audio setup (PTP3)"}
    ]
  },
  "notes": [
    "All standard polling uses SDIO_GetAllExtDevicePropInfo (0x9209) which returns ALL available properties in one blob.",
    "The polling groups here define which property values to EXTRACT and act on from the blob, not separate poll requests.",
    "High priority props are extracted every poll cycle (200ms).",
    "Medium and Low priority props are extracted less frequently even though they appear in every blob.",
    "ON_DEMAND props are queried individually via SDIO_GetExtDeviceProp (0x9251, PTP3) or parsed from a full poll blob when needed.",
    "SAB currently extracts only: iso, fnumber, shutter_speed, exp_comp, color_temperature, battery_remaining, movie_rec_state, and inferred remaining_time (0xD3C2/0xD3C4 which are NOT in official docs)."
  ]
}
